{"id": "69334", "title": "温暖", "author": "Aine", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 21, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69334.htm", "intro": "灰姑娘的戏码在这个世界上每天都在上演，\r\n\r\n民众对这种爱情向往的同时，也不免唏嘘真爱难遇。\r\n\r\n然，作为落难公主的初尘却明白，人世间最最不可企求的就是爱情。\r\n\r\n她十八岁之前是军区大院里人见人爱的小公主。\r\n\r\n十八岁那年，随着父亲的入-狱，本应顺风顺水的人生被彻底颠覆。\r\n\r\n初恋男友高一的背叛，已经被忘记的故知辛穆，以及家族与家族之间的仇恨。\r\n\r\n\r\n人到底是应该活在过去还是活在当下，爱情来临之时，谁人都无法抗拒。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69334", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10614724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10614725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10614726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10614727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10614728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10614729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10614730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10614731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10614732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10614733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10614734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-60", "file": "10614735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10614736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "10614737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-77", "file": "10614738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "78-84", "file": "10614739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "85-90", "file": "10614740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-97", "file": "10614741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "98-103", "file": "10614742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "104-111", "file": "10614743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "112-118完结", "file": "10614744.html", "available": false}]}